<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Wednesday updated figures of livestock exports to Mexico from the state of Texas to June 2.</p>
<p>Species		   Wk-To-Date   Yr-Date   Last Year</p>
<p>1) Beef Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		481	    50,602     34,473</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   1	     1,141	  678</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	 0	     2,341	  852</p>
<p>Total			  482	    54,084     36,003</p>
<p>2) Hogs</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		  0		 410     31,831</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   0		 335	  140</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	 0	     4,424	  846</p>
<p>3) Dairy Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Breeding Males	   0		 118	   33</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Females     215	    12,672	6,018</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
